    "body": "@reillyeon\n\n> Closing this issue because the correct solution as mentioned above is to use WebHID.\n\nBut the WebHID API is not available on Android at the moment.\n\nAlthough I do see updates appearing in the https://issues.chromium.org/issues/40628009 from time to time.\n\nIs there active work underway on bringing WebHID API support to Android?\n\nThe target is currently set to 2027/Q1 — is that realistic?\n\nI also saw news the other day that Web Serial API became available on Android (https://developer.chrome.com/release-notes/148#web_serial_api_on_android), but I haven’t had a chance to try it yet.\n\nBy the way, would I be able to control the device described in my first message using Web Serial API on Android?",
